WEBVTT

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.600
Th-This can't be happening!

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.600
Even Groribas, our best warrior was defeated?!

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.820
Just what kind of creature is he ?
How he got on the ship anyway?{What manner of creature is he?
And how'd he get aboard?}

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.030
Damn it!

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.950
Melzargard was supposed
to be guarding the ship!

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:58.120
Now he and I are
the only elite fighters left!

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.450
I bet he's just mucking about...

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.120
I need him now!

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.920
Curse the bastard!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.960
Geryuganshoop,
what is the problem?

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.760
Lord Boros!
I-I'm terribly sorry.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.260
I've allowed one of the natives
to infiltrate the ship.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.840
In the mere four minutes
since coming aboard,

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.930
he has damaged 23%
of the ship.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.060
It seems he is alone,

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.810
but he has managed
to instantly kill

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.060
every warrior sent to
intercept him.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.600
Do not panic.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.730
As long as the power sphere
is safe,

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:31.780
the ship will not go down.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:36.360
The damage so far is limited to
the crew's living quarters.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.660
But minnows won't be enough.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.490
Geryuganshoop...

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:45.210
you, Groribas and Melzargard,
my top lieutenants,

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.290
will go eliminate this intruder.

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:51.090
Groribas has fallen, sir...

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:53.300
What?

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.380
Let me get Melzargard back here!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:01.510
He and I together will wipe out
the intruder without fail!

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:14.810
